    "title": "Free fall Main Street Fest features live music and shopping - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Abbey Bowling ,\n11 hours ago DALLAS (KDAF) — The Village will host its annual Fall Main Street Fest on Friday, Oct. 2, from 5 p.m. to 9 p.m. along Main Street. The festival is free and open to the public, offering live music and local shopping to mark the beginning of the fall season. Attendees are encouraged to RSVP in advance through an online ticket link. Read full article\n2",
